
---

## `.gitignore`

Вставь:

```gitignore
# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Environment variables / secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Test/cache files
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Build artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# IDE/editor files
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Project outputs
data/output/
logs/
